# S0p hold twin of pf_reorg_clean.prog (OD-L3-119 item 2): the same input under the hold W schedule,
# header bit 1 only.
start hold
# S0p: a fan-out main, then a heavier fan-out fork whose connects may flush mid-op (a reconcile
# follows its mirror); a KILL and a CLEAN restart after the mirrors.
extend main 8 tx=fan
extend main 8 tx=fan
fork 3 8 tx=fan
extend b1 8 tx=fan
restart kill
extend main 2 tx=fan
restart clean
extend main 1
